# Inexact fixed-width subtype conversion rejects a variable source

Verifies the shared conversion rule rejects an inexact `int8` value from a
variable before an array insertion can truncate it.

>>> source
let source: int8 = 15mm
let sizes: int8<cm>[] = []
sizes->push(source)

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: cannot convert `int8` to `int8`

<<< exit
1
